---
source: crates/runtime/tests/search/mod.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, trunc(_score, 3) as _score FROM vector_search(qs, 'secondary', answer) where subject!='math' order by _score desc, id LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).id ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                  |
|               |   Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).answer, trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer)._score, Int64(3)) AS _score                                      |
|               |     Filter: vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).subject != Utf8("math")                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |       Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer)._score, vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).answer, vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).subject       |
|               |         SearchTelemetry                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer)                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |             Projection: search_index._score, base_table.answer, search_index.answer_embedding, search_index.id, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                 |
|               |               Sort: search_index._score DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                 Projection: search_index.id, search_index.answer_embedding, search_index._score, base_table.answer, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                             |
|               |                   Left Join: search_index.id = base_table.id                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                     SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                       SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                         Projection: CAST(tbl.key AS Int64) AS id, tbl.data AS answer_embedding, Float64(1) - tbl.distance AS _score                                                                                                     |
|               |                           TableScan: tbl                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     Projection: base_table.answer, base_table.id, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                                                               |
|               |                       TableScan: base_table projection=[answer, id, question, reference_answer, source, subject]                                                                                                                        |
| physical_plan | SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@2 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[id@2 as id, answer@1 as answer, trunc(_score@0, 3) as _score]                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |       FilterExec: subject@3 != math, projection=[_score@0, answer@1, id@2]                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |         ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@0 as _score, answer@1 as answer, id@3 as id, subject@7 as subject]                                                                                                                                 |
|               |           SearchTelemetryExec                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@2 as _score, answer@3 as answer, answer_embedding@1 as answer_embedding, id@0 as id, question@4 as question, reference_answer@5 as reference_answer, source@6 as source, subject@7 as subject] |
|               |               HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1)], projection=[id@0, answer_embedding@1, _score@2, answer@3, question@5, reference_answer@6, source@7, subject@8]      |
|               |                 CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   ProjectionExec: expr=[CAST(key@1 AS Int64) as id, data@0 as answer_embedding, 1 - distance@2 as _score]                                                                                                               |
|               |                     RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                       CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                         BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                           S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                   SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                     CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                       BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                         DuckSqlExec sql= SELECT "answer", "id", "question", "reference_answer", "source", "subject" FROM qs                                                                                                             |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
